succeed. The function fails when the Locale value is not one of the
default values listed above.

[備考]
A call to ConvertDefaultLocale specifying LOCALE_SYSTEM_DEFAULT is
equivalent to a call to GetSystemDefaultLCID. A call to
ConvertDefaultLocale specifying LOCALE_USER_DEFAULT is equivalent to
a call to GetUserDefaultLCID.


