[備考]
Deleting a mounted folder does not cause the underlying directory to
be deleted. If the lpszVolumeMountPoint parameter is a directory that
is not a mounted folder, the function does nothing. The directory is
not deleted. In Windows 8 and Windows Server 2012, this function is
supported by the following technologies.
