function fails, the return value is zero. To get extended error
information, call GetLastError.

[備考]
The GetCommModemStatus function is useful when you are using the
WaitCommEvent function to monitor the CTS, RLSD, DSR, or ring
indicator signals. To detect when these signals change state, use
WaitCommEvent and then use GetCommModemStatus to determine the state
after a change occurs. The function fails if the hardware does not
support the control-register values.


