[備考]
The GetComputerName function retrieves the NetBIOS name established
at system startup. Name changes made by the SetComputerName or
SetComputerNameEx functions do not take effect until the user
restarts the computer. If the caller is running under a client
session, this function returns the server name. To retrieve the
client name, use the WTSQuerySessionInformation function.


