GetMailslotInfo
Retrieves information about the specified mailslot.
%group
Win32 kernel32
%prm
hMailslot, lpMaxMessageSize, lpNextSize, lpMessageCount, lpReadTimeout
hMailslot : [intptr] A handle to a mailslot. The CreateMailslot function must create this handle.
lpMaxMessageSize : [var] The maximum message size, in bytes, allowed for this mailslot. This value can be greater than or equal to the value specified in the cbMaxMsg parameter of the CreateMailslot function that created the mailslot. This parameter can be NULL.
lpNextSize : [var] The size of the next message, in bytes. The following value has special meaning.
lpMessageCount : [var] The total number of messages waiting to be read, when the function returns. This parameter can be NULL.
