GroupCount : [var] On input, specifies the number of elements in GroupArray array. On output, specifies the number of processor groups written to the array. If the array is too small, the function fails with ERROR_INSUFFICIENT_BUFFER and sets the GroupCount parameter to the number of elements required.
GroupArray : [var] An array of processor group numbers. A group number is included in the array if a thread in the process is assigned to a processor in the group.
