information, call GetLastError.

[備考]
Use GetVolumeNameForVolumeMountPoint to obtain a volume GUID path for
use with functions such as SetVolumeMountPoint and
FindFirstVolumeMountPoint that require a volume GUID path as an input
parameter. For more information about volume GUID paths, see Naming A
Volume. In Windows 8 and Windows Server 2012, this function is
