lpLocaleName : [wstr] Pointer to a locale name, or one of the following predefined values.
lpVersionInformation : [var] Pointer to an NLSVERSIONINFOEX structure. The application must initialize the dwNLSVersionInfoSize member to  sizeof(NLSVERSIONINFOEX).
