Initialize the NLSVERSIONINFOEX structure by calling GetNLSVersionEx.
See the Remarks for GetNLSVersionEx for a discussion on how the
members of NLSVERSIONINFOEX can be used to determine if a sort
version has changed and you need to reindex data. Beginning in
