dwFlags : [int] Before?Windows?7: Reserved; should always be 0. Starting with?Windows?7: Can be set to LOCALE_ALLOW_NEUTRAL_NAMES to allow the return of a neutral name.
%inst
Converts a locale identifier to a locale name.

