The handles identifying the source and destination files must be
retrieved by calling the LZInit or LZOpenFile function. If the
function succeeds, the file identified by the hfDest parameter is
always uncompressed. In Windows 8 and Windows Server 2012, this
function is supported by the following technologies.
This doc was truncated.


