The handle identifying the file must be retrieved by calling either
the LZInit or LZOpenFile function. If the file is compressed, LZRead
operates on an expanded image of the file and copies the bytes of
data into the specified buffer. In Windows 8 and Windows Server 2012,
this function is supported by the following technologies.
