%index
PowerCreateRequest
Creates a new power request object.
%group
Win32 kernel32
%prm
Context
Context : [var] Points to a REASON_CONTEXT structure that contains information about the power request.
%inst
Creates a new power request object.

[戻り値]
If the function succeeds, the return value is a handle to the power
request object. If the function fails, the return value is
INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE. To get extended error information, call
GetLastError.

[備考]
When the power request object is no longer needed, use the
