function fails, the return value is zero. To get extended error
information, call GetLastError. The following are possible error
codes for this function.
This doc was truncated.

[備考]
Tip Starting with Windows 10, version 1607, for the unicode version
of this function (ReplaceFileW), you can opt-in to remove the
MAX_PATH limitation. See the "Maximum Path Length Limitation" section
of Naming Files, Paths, and Namespaces for details. The ReplaceFile
