indicate that the passed SYSTEMTIME structure represents an invalid
date. Certain situations, such as the additional day added in a leap
year, can result in application logic unexpectedly creating an
invalid date. For more information on avoiding these issues, see
[leap year
readiness](https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/azure-developer-community-blog/it-s-2020-is-your-code-ready-for-leap-day/ba-p/1157279).


